---
import '../styles/global.css';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  chapter?: 'intro' | 'people' | 'model' | 'ai';
  crumb?: string;
}
const { title, description, chapter = 'people', crumb } = Astro.props;
const repo = 'https://github.com/kevintsou-dsc/Agentic-Era';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f3eee4" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body class={`ch-${chapter}`}>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">跳到主要內容</a>
    <div class="progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-progress></span></div>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a href="/" class="mono">決策智慧 2026</a>
      {crumb && <span class="crumb">{crumb}</span>}
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <slot />
    </main>
    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p>內容出自 電通行銷傳播集團《決策智慧 2026：Agentic 時代，重塑品牌與人的真實距離》。所載編輯內容之著作權為原刊所有。</p>
        <p><a href="/#chapters">依章節找文章</a>　<a href="/about/">關於本作品</a>　<a href={repo}>原始碼</a></p>
      </div>
    </footer>
    <script>
      import { initScrolly } from '../scripts/scrolly';
      initScrolly();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  .skip { position: absolute; left: -999px; top: 8px; z-index: 60; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .skip:focus { left: 8px; }
  .crumb { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; max-width: 60vw; }
  .footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 32px 0 48px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .footer p { margin: 0 0 8px; max-width: 46rem; }
  .footer a { margin-right: 4px; }
</style>
